          "locator": "runtime notes",
          "observation": "The nightly batch is 40,000 rows and about 3 percent have malformed company names that never return a complete result."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes",
          "observation": "enrich.lookup is billed per call and the API key and monthly quota are shared with sales and marketing; when the quota runs out, their tools stop working until the next month."
